{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"mustard-fungoid-grackle","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Context / Problem\nThe `external LLM (live bedrock)` job of the `Live External Integration` workflow failed on dispatch run 42939278248 (https://github.com/navapbc/rebar/actions/runs/42939278248, started 2026-11-10 17:29 PST on main at 91182f96362). It passed on dispatch run 42684304178 (2026-11-09 PST).\n\nFailure: `tests/external/test_structured_output_matrix.py::test_structured_output_matrix` raised `rebar.llm.errors.LLMInputRejectedError` wrapping pydantic-ai `ContentFilterError`. Bedrock returned `finish_reason: content_filtered`, 0 output tokens, 413 input tokens, model `us.anthropic.claude-opus-5-5`, us-east-1, provider_response_id aec55d4f-e070-4f37-946c-0e5f9cd3dc17, execution_mode single_turn. System prompt: \"You are a completion verifier that emits a single structured verdict.\" Job summary: 1 failed, 20 passed, 1 skipped.\n\nBetween the green and red runs, 06b3b1a5230 (Gerrit 3340, ticket beaten-natural-grouse) moved `.github/llm-providers/bedrock.toml` to `bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-5-5` / sonnet-5-5 / haiku-5-5. Not yet established: which (variant, prompt) cell was filtered (the matrix sends `_AGENTIC_TRANSCRIPT_PROMPT` and `_SINGLE_SHOT_PROMPT` under each directive variant), whether the refusal is deterministic, and whether it relates to the known Bedrock Opus 5.5 refusal of reasoning-requesting calls noted on epic pompous-vitriolic-macaw.\n\nImpact: the workflow concludes failure, which also blocks the last criterion of unkempt-amaranth-archerfish (the next scheduled run must conclude success).\n\nFound while working deceptive-banal-baboon; not worked (hold on new bugs).\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Root cause identified: the filtered cell and the request feature that triggers the filter, reproduced against Bedrock Opus 5.5.\n- [ ] Fix lands through Gerrit with LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1; no new config key, env var or feature flag.\n- [ ] [non-codebase] A `Live External Integration` run on main after the fix shows `external LLM (live bedrock)` concluding success; run id recorded on this ticket.","id":"95bd-beb1-8c3f-465f","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"Live bedrock CI arm: Opus 5.5 returns content_filtered on test_structured_output_matrix after the 5.5 model upgrade"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1794361354781575708,"uuid":"bba46a87-3a98-4013-bebe-19e11f892113"}